   "source": [
    "## 2. Data Preparation\n",
    "\n",
    "Adjusted closing prices were extracted from the downloaded market data.\n",
    "\n",
    "Because Bitcoin trades seven days a week while ETFs trade primarily on business days, dates containing missing observations were removed to ensure all assets were compared using the same trading dates.\n",
    "\n",
    "Daily percentage returns were then calculated from the cleaned price series."
   ]
  },
