   "source": [
    "## 3. Risk & Return Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Annualized return and annualized volatility were calculated to compare the historical performance and risk characteristics of each asset.\n",
    "\n",
    "Annualized volatility measures the dispersion of daily returns and provides an indication of the magnitude of price fluctuations experienced by each asset."
   ]
  },
