   "source": [
    "### Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Bitcoin** generated the highest annualized return at **52.61%**, but also recorded substantially higher volatility at **61.39%**.\n",
    "- **QQQ** returned **19.80%** annually with **25.31%** volatility, exceeding SPY in both return and volatility.\n",
    "- **Gold** recorded an **18.45%** annualized return with comparatively lower volatility of **16.34%**.\n",
    "- **TLT** recorded a negative annualized return of **-4.59%** during the sample period."
   ]
  },
