   "source": [
    "### Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "- A hypothetical **USD 10,000 investment in Bitcoin** grew to approximately **USD 125,272.64**, the highest ending value in the analysis, while also experiencing substantially greater volatility and drawdown risk.\n",
    "- The **equal-weight portfolio** grew to approximately **USD 35,028.10**.\n",
    "- QQQ, Gold, and SPY also generated substantial positive cumulative returns over the sample period.\n",
    "- TLT produced the weakest cumulative performance among the assets analyzed.\n",
    "\n",
    "The results highlight the distinction between maximizing historical absolute return and managing the risk associated with achieving that return."
   ]
