    "## 9. Maximum Drawdown Comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "Maximum drawdown was calculated for each individual asset and the equal-weight portfolio to compare the severity of historical peak-to-trough losses.\n",
    "\n",
    "This provides an additional perspective on risk beyond volatility and Sharpe ratios."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "5c54412c-3dc2-440a-8a64-a2c2705ed47a",
