    "### Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "- Bitcoin experienced the largest maximum drawdown at **-76.63%**, highlighting the substantial downside risk associated with its high historical returns.\n",
    "- TLT recorded a maximum drawdown of **-48.35%**.\n",
    "- The equal-weight portfolio experienced a maximum drawdown of **-37.74%**.\n",
    "- QQQ and SPY recorded maximum drawdowns of **-35.12%** and **-33.72%**, respectively.\n",
    "- Gold had the smallest maximum drawdown in the analysis at **-22.00%**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Diversification improved several portfolio-level risk characteristics, but it did not produce the smallest maximum drawdown. Different risk measures therefore provide different perspectives on portfolio performance."
